  {
    "id": "1244764",
    "original": "パリなどでは、夏になると、細君や子供を避暑地にやつて置いて、夫は、土曜日の晩から日曜へかけてそこへ出掛けて行く風習があります。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "1245080",
        "text": "In Paris and elsewhere, in the summer, husbands send their wives and children somewhere to escape the heat and they customarily leave to visit them on Saturday evening until Sunday."
